<title>No Alarms</title>
<link>http://xs.xploder.net/xploder/xploderui.asp?un=xdnv2&amp;platformid=1&amp;tab=gc&amp;gameid=14785</link>
<description>Loaded elf into IDA. Noticed it has debug symbols.  Looked for the word 'Alarm' and found a func called:-  prpAlarmSystem::alarmON(vkVec3 *)  Had a look at that and it looks like the func to turn the alrams on AND off.. So changed it so the alarms can only be turned off !</description>
