<link>http://xs.xploder.net/xploder/xploderui.asp?un=xdnv2&amp;platformid=1&amp;tab=gc&amp;gameid=14785</link>
<description>Trained for the shadow meter moving up and down as I moved in and out of shadow. Found a float. Noticed that a flag is set next to the float.. 0 = no shadow, 1 = in shadow. So did a break on read and found the code that reads this value, then changed it to always be in shadow.</description>
